<title>JAPAN: Toyoda Loom jumps on share repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Toyoda Loom jumps on share repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Toyoda Automatic Loom Works Ltd jumped in Monday afternoon trade on continuing enthusiasm for the firm's share repurchase plan, brokers said.</p>
<p>The high liquidity of the shares was also attractive, especially for dealers, they said.</p>
<p>As of 0456 GMT, the share was up 120 yen at 2,640, with trade totalling 2.25 million shares, putting it seventh on the list of heavily traded issues.</p>
</text>
